SUMMARY:Back to the Future... Smashed!
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Fresh from a year of sell-out shows\, Impromptu Theatre present
 s a show where the audience is in control. Our increasingly tipsy actors tr
 y to navigate a brand-new\, unscripted performance of Back to the Future wh
 ile the audience influence the show. Every night is different! The audience
  chooses a new setting for the story\, curveballs in scenes\, and some memb
 ers will get the responsibility of triggering songs\, challenges and more! 
 Chaos will ensue as the story you know and love is affectionately twisted i
 n a way not even the performers will see coming.\nMore info: https://comedy
 atlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/back-to-the-future-smashed/
